{"path":"container/list/clear","title":"std::list<T,Allocator>::clear","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::list&lt;T,Allocator&gt;::</span>clear","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/list/clear","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Erases all elements from the container. After this call, size() returns zero.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> clear<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(noexcept since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Erases all elements from the container. After this call, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list/size\">size()</a></span> returns zero.\n</p><p>Invalidates any references, pointers, and iterators referring to contained elements.\nAny past-the-end iterator remains valid.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Linear in the size of the container, i.e., the number of elements.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string_view&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;list&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> print_info<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\"><span class=\"kw1256\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string_view</span></span></a> rem, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list\"><span class=\"kw1283\">std::<span class=\"me2\">list</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> v<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> rem <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"{ \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> value <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> v<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> value <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"}<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Size=\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> v.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list\"><span class=\"kw1283\">std::<span class=\"me2\">list</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> container<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print_info<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Before clear: \"</span>, container<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    container.<span class=\"me1\">clear</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print_info<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"After clear: \"</span>, container<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Before clear: { 1 2 3 }\nSize=3\nAfter clear: { }\nSize=0</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue2231\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 2231</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++11\n</td>\n<td>complexity guarantee was mistakenly omitted in C++11\n</td>\n<td>complexity reaffirmed as linear\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list/erase\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>erase</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  erases elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/list","title":"std::list"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::list<T,Allocator>::clear","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Erases all elements from the container. After this call, size() returns zero."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Linear in the size of the container, i.e., the number of elements."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"erase","note":"erases elements"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":169,"codeBlockCount":2}
